std::print(\"{}\\n\",r.value_at(1)); // 0.125
```

**References**

- MFEM, Weak Formulations: https://mfem.org/fem_weak_form/ . This native implementation
  uses P1 intervals, three-point Gauss-Legendre loads and a tridiagonal direct solve.

