  parameter1  double-float  Primary df or count parameter; consult the test contract.
  parameter2  double-float  Secondary df/count parameter where used; otherwise zero.
  p-value  double-float  Null-reference p-value, not adjusted for multiple testing.
  estimate1  double-float  First test-specific estimate, such as a mean, ratio or correlation.
  estimate2  double-float  Second estimate when applicable, such as a second group mean.
  conf-int-lower  double-float  Lower confidence bound, meaningful only when has_conf_int.
  conf-int-upper  double-float  Upper confidence bound, meaningful only when has_conf_int.
  has-conf-int  boolean  Whether confidence bounds were computed for this result.
  alternative  alternative  Tail requested by the caller.
