  std::invalid_argument: If the coordinates are empty or have different lengths.

See also: points(), set_col(), plot()

  (make-r-plot) → r-plot
  (make-r-plot x y) → r-plot
    x  (vector double-float)  Horizontal coordinates, one per point.
    y  (vector double-float)  Vertical coordinates, paired with `x` by position."
