    coefficients  (vector double-float)  One coefficient per basis function.
  (make-tensor-b-spline bases coefficients) → tensor-b-spline
    bases  (vector b-spline-basis)  One basis per dimension (at least one).
    coefficients  (vector double-float)  Row-major net whose size is the product of the basis sizes."
  (make-instance 'datamunge:tensor-b-spline :args args))

